// Dialog :
"P4086797535" "<color deepskyblue>RICHARD FLAGG TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: One<br><br></color>So, the Rikti are onto us, huh? Well, it's a good thing you were there to rescue the good doctor. She's an expert on Rikti tech; if anyone can get that transmitter to cough up the goodies, it's her."
// RandomFameString :
"P4065832218" "I hear the military has discovered a way to listen in on the Rikti's plans."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - DiscoverHideout 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P346220969" "<color deepskyblue>RICHARD FLAGG TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Two<br><br></color>Well, the good Dr. Dower got the job done all right. She's developed these interceptors that should let us listen in on the Rikti plans. <color orange>We just need someone to run around the war zone and place them in certain strategic locations.<color> I hope I can depend upon you for that."
// AcceptString :
"P2822055970" "Place interceptors"
// SendOffString :
"P1263794281" "<color deepskyblue>RICHARD FLAGG TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Two<br><br></color>Excellent.  The locations will be marked for you.  Place one interceptor at each location.  We'll have to hide them in ordinary objects to make sure that the Rikti don't discover them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - DiscoverHideout_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3016822815" "Place transmission interceptors"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1805380458" "<color deepskyblue>RICHARD FLAGG TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Two<br><br></color>Are those interceptors in place yet? {TaskForceName}, if we're going to foil the Rikti plot, you'll have to get cracking!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1745983680" "You receive an urgent message from Major Flagg."

