"P933792653" "Here are the transmission interceptors. Don't drop 'em; the doc says they're pretty fragile."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4282201972" "<color deepskyblue>RICHARD FLAGG TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Two<br><br></color>We've picked up some disturbing intel from those interceptors you placed. It seems the Rikti are interested in the Terra Volta reactor. We've had some close shaves in the past trying to keep that reactor safe, and it looks like the Rikti are going to give us a run for our money again. <br><br>Those explosives you found are what really worries me. If the Rikti manage to blow up the reactor core, there'll be fallout for miles! All of Paragon City will have to be evacuated!"
// RandomFameString :
"P1613943133" "I hear {TaskForceName} is onto a big Rikti plot!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - ReactorCore 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3125837464" "<color deepskyblue>RICHARD FLAGG TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>If the Rikti manage to blow up that reactor, Paragon City is gone. Finished. We'll have to evacuate, and even a quick response won't stop some citizens from falling prey to radiation poisoning. That means this one is for all the marbles, {TaskForceName}. <color orange>You've got to save the Terra Volta reactor from the Rikti!</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P3405373490" "Save the Terra Volta reactor"
// SendOffString :
"P629698174" "<color deepskyblue>RICHARD FLAGG TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>I'll begin coordinating an evacuation plan. If you can't stop the Rikti, we'll need one."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P247627655" "Save Terra Volta reactor"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3317808640" "<color deepskyblue>RICHARD FLAGG TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>The Rikti are going to blow up the Terra Volta reactor unless you do something to stop it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2583903638" "<span align=center><color orange><font face=title>Reactor Core</font></color><br><br>A scream echoes through the halls. It sounds like the Rikti are already here.</span>"

