// Dialog :
"P2164188449" "<color deepskyblue>RICHARD FLAGG TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>I know you did your best, {TaskForceName}, and luckily Freedom Corps arrived in time to pick up the slack. The reactor core is safe, at least for now. Only trouble is, the Rikti are a persistent lot. <br><br>I wouldn't be surprised to see them try something like this again. If you'd like to continue to protect the reactor core, please come back."
// RandomFameString :
"P3218197982" "The Freedom Corps saved the Terra Volta reactor!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3114670729" "<color deepskyblue>RICHARD FLAGG TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>Well, well, {TaskForceName}. Congratulations! You pulled off the biggest save Paragon City has seen since the days of the first Rikti Invasion! All of Paragon City owes you a debt of gratitude today, my friends. Let me be the first to say thank you. <br><br>If I were you, I'd get over to City Hall in Atlas Park. There's a man there named James Wolfe who specializes in understanding the effects of radiation. After a day like this one, it wouldn't hurt to have him check you out."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// RandomFameString :
"P655678166" "{TaskForceName} stopped the Rikti from destroying the Terra Volta reactor!"

